        "id": 8292,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-04T02:55:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I know Paul's managing things as far as the official volunteers for &gt;G at all the cons, but I wanted to drop a place for all of us who are going to be at PAX Prime to talk about it.</p>\n<p>Is anyone going as a volunteer? (See <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/volun-tiers-for-2013-conventions-2923\">Paul’s Volun-Tiers thread </a>for the details, if you’re interested in doing so but haven’t heard about it.) Anyone just attending PAX that we might meet up with?</p>\n<p>I'll be there as a volunteer, fulltime, at the booth.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Trying to decide if I want to bring the Ra costume (once I fix it from the issues suffered at Origins). I usually don't check bags, but I might have to make an exception for this one as I haven't figured out how to get the costume to fit in my carry-on bags.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:46.669Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 5.0,
        "yours": false,
