        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I know Paul&#39;s managing things as far as the official volunteers for &gt;G at all the cons, but I wanted to drop a place for all of us who are going to be at PAX Prime to talk about it.\n\nIs anyone going as a volunteer? (See <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/volun-tiers-for-2013-conventions-2923\">Paul&#39;s Volun-Tiers thread </a>for the details, if you&#39;re interested in doing so but haven&#39;t heard about it.) Anyone just attending PAX that we might meet up with?\n\nI&#39;ll be there as a volunteer, fulltime, at the booth.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nTrying to decide if I want to bring the Ra costume (once I fix it from the issues suffered at Origins). I usually don&#39;t check bags, but I might have to make an exception for this one as I haven&#39;t figured out how to get the costume to fit in my carry-on bags.  :confused: ",
