        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-05T16:33:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am 100% in favor of Ra costumes, FYI :)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'd also love to hear from people who will be at PAX, whether you want to formally volunteer with us, or just hang out! At PAX East we met a number of cool Sentinels fans and wound up spending a fair amount of time with them outside of exhibit hall hours, and I'd love to meet more people at Prime!</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:45:14.595Z",
