        "raw": "<p>I am 100% in favor of Ra costumes, FYI :)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'd also love to hear from people who will be at PAX, whether you want to formally volunteer with us, or just hang out! At PAX East we met a number of cool Sentinels fans and wound up spending a fair amount of time with them outside of exhibit hall hours, and I'd love to meet more people at Prime!</p>",
